      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/50/5016057cdb699ad0a_w.webp",
      "description": "The Miyagi Prefecture Qualifier finals of the Spring High School Volleyball Tournament. The ones to stand before Karasuno High School are the undefeated champions, Shiratorizawa Academy. Do they have a chance to win against the ultimate spiker, Ushijima? Their battle towards the nationals finally begins..."
    },
    {
      "episode": 2,
      "episodeNumber": 2,
      "title": "The Threat of the \"Left\"",
      "aired": "2016-10-15T01:55:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2016-10-15T01:55:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/50/5030053e83c487da9_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/50/5030053e83c487da9_w.webp",
      "description": "The Miyagi Prefecture Qualifier finals of the Spring High School Volleyball Tournament. From the very beginning of the match, Ushijima attacks with his powerful spikes. Because he`s not used to left-handed attacks, their Guardian Deity, Nishinoya, has a hard time receiving them. What is Karasuno`s plan to deal with the mounting point difference?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 3,
      "episodeNumber": 3,
      "title": "Guess-Monster",
      "aired": "2016-10-22T01:55:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2016-10-22T01:55:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/50/504611534f3de0f46_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/50/504611534f3de0f46_w.webp",
      "description": "The match is now in the second match. Karasuno tries to attack, but Shiratorizawa`s middle blocker, Tendo keeps blocking all of their attempts. As he blocked Karasuno`s spikes on after another, Tsukishima calmly stared at their opponent`s side of the court.."
    },
    {
      "episode": 4,
      "episodeNumber": 4,
      "title": "The Halo Around the Moon",
      "aired": "2016-10-29T01:55:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2016-10-29T01:55:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": "https://simkl.in/episodes/50/506363720259c7336_w.webp",
      "imageUrl": "https://simkl.in/episodes/50/506363720259c7336_w.webp",
      "description": "The last part of the 2nd set. Karasuno comes back at Shiratorizawa with Tsukishima and Nishinoya`s total defense. They end up in a heated battle in the end, resulting in multiple deuces... Who will score the final point?"
    },
    {
      "episode": 5,
      "episodeNumber": 5,
      "title": "Individual vs Numbers",
